{"v":4,"desc":"Fortress Building Puzzle 是一款益智遊戲，您需要有策略地移除所有立方體，才能將您的城堡推向地面，高度很高。\n     您必須仔細考慮要移除哪些立方體以及移除的順序，因為結構必須保持平衡，否則它會過早倒塌。\n您可以從立方體的地板上選擇難度。\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 無限時間將城堡推向地面，因此在困難的關卡中您可以停留數小時\n- 所有級別都有解決方案，這裡的一切都基於物理學\n- 選擇你想要的難度\n\n     總的來說，Fortress Building Puzzle 是一款有趣且具有挑戰性的遊戲，非常考驗玩家的戰略思維和解決問題的能力。","publisher":"SimulatorMaker Studio","release":"2023-04-20","genres":["策略","訓練","街機","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8c1bd7af771ada6e9896f5cf7eb849fe4678d1530fbef29f2341d8861d80a75f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/084b23816259274a91ec97ed599e17d35472b334f12af3ee0ae8bf86e4322781.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65441a60f265ee0636bdcda1586d3b11539cd522ddc7fbc9e7c626622b723a66.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f76f7dbf14cea6a0fb4ec364495e02f1bf3a53e7a246895b444d0db50816674.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3446deac88e89faaa8a9adee2413d60c246b5e4178af174b40f3baac3d407de8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e8cb51d7cbfa75317cae9c014babf235199ff7357eb5993731278996e7bfcbb.jpg"],"titleId":"01003ec019492000","dlc":[]}